From c8c60d356ba3586def6cbf57d9d9bc8ad04327bd Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: daveey <daveey@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 26 Oct 2026 14:29:15 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] docs(kanban): condense timed park explanation [daveey]


Public-series adaptation: preserve merged preceding changes.


Final ordered-series reconciliation: retain pinned source merge-only safety deltas
(comment ordering watermark, unknown subscription/closeout obligations, typed wake
arguments and their regressions). Non-merge format-patch omits these changes.


Additional merge reconciliation: preserve extracted block helpers and capture the
offline fixture once (its timestamp is time-dependent), matching merged source.

